Install exactly one role package on this machine: pathchord-ingressd for an
Ingress client or pathchord-egressd for an Egress host. The packages conflict;
remove the installed profile explicitly before replacing it. Private operator
configuration, identities and authorization state are preserved.

The selected role uses the local non-login pathchord account. Its configuration
is under %%PREFIX%%/etc/pathchord/<role> and private state under
/var/db/pathchord-<role>. Enable only its matching rc.d service in /etc/rc.conf.
Before starting Egress, provision /var/db/pathchord-egress/egress.key.json and
set its intended bind in egress.yaml. The packaged default remains loopback.

The selected daemon, pathchordctl, pathchord(1) and matching rc.d definition are
installed; the other role's daemon, service and default configuration are absent.
